ate-400\">MERN Stack Developer • Kathmandu, Nepal</p></div></div><img src=\"/hero-kundan.svg\" alt=\"Illustration of Kundan as a web developer\" class=\"mt-6 w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-800\"/><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-200\"><a href=\"mailto:kundanprasadyadav15@gmail.com\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/70 px-3 py-2 transition hover:border-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300\"><span class=\"text-slate-400\">Email<!-- -->:</span> <!-- -->kundanprasadyadav15@gmail.com</a><a href=\"tel:+9779742471815\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/70 px-3 py-2 transition hover:border-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300\"><span class=\"text-slate-400\">Phone<!-- -->:</span> <!-- -->+977 9742471815</a><a href=\"https://github.com/kundanYadav1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/70 px-3 py-2 transition hover:border-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300\"><span class=\"text-slate-400\">GitHub<!-- -->:</span> <!-- -->github.com/kundanYadav1</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kundan-prasad-yadav-9a7328192/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/70 px-3 py-2 transition hover:border-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300\"><span class=\"text-slate-400\">LinkedIn<!-- -->:</span> <!-- -->linkedin.com/in/kundan-prasad-yadav-9a7328192</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 lg:p-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-300\">About</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white\">Computer Engineering graduate and freelance developer in Kathmandu.</h2></div><p class=\"text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">I am Kundan Prasad Yadav, a B.Tech in Computer Engineering graduate from NIMS University Jaipur, class of 2021–2025. I work with the MERN Stack to build responsive web applications, business websites, and custom digital experiences for clients in Nepal, with a strong focus on performance, SEO, and modern design.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"projects\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-300\">Projects &amp; Services</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-white\">What I help clients build</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70\"><img src=\"/project-doctor-appointment.svg\" alt=\"Doctor Appointment\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">Doctor Appointment</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">A clean booking-focused web app concept for patients and doctors, designed to simplify appointments and service discovery.</p><a href=\"https://github.com/kundanYadav1/doctor-appointment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-sky-300 hover:text-sky-200\">View on GitHub →</a></div></article><article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70\"><img src=\"/project-movie-book.svg\" alt=\"Movie Book\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">Movie Book</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">A modern movie discovery experience with a polished UI, trending lists, and smooth browsing for film lovers.</p><a href=\"https://github.com/kundanYadav1/movie-book\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-sky-300 hover:text-sky-200\">View on GitHub →</a></div></article><article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70\"><img src=\"/project-3d-portfolio.svg\" alt=\"3D Portfolio\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">3D Portfolio</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">An interactive personal portfolio concept with immersive visuals and a futuristic feel to present work creatively.</p><a href=\"https://github.com/kundanYadav1/3d-portfolio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-sky-300 hover:text-sky-200\">View on GitHub →</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 lg:p-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-300\">Skills</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white\">Technologies I use to build and grow digital products.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">MongoDB</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Express.js</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">React</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Node.js</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Next.js</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">REST APIs</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">SEO</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Freelance Development</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 lg:p-10\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-300\">FAQs</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white\">Common questions about my work and services</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Who is Kundan Prasad Yadav?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Kundan Prasad Yadav is a B.Tech Computer Engineering graduate from NIMS University Jaipur and a MERN Stack developer based in Kathmandu, Nepal.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white\">What services does Kundan offer?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">He builds modern websites, web applications, and freelance development solutions using React, Next.js, Node.js, MongoDB, and SEO-friendly practices.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Where is Kundan based?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Kundan is based in Kathmandu, Nepal, and works with clients locally and remotely.</p></article></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 p-8 text-center lg:p-12\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sky-300\">Contact</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white\">Let&#x27;s build a website that ranks, performs, and converts.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">If you need a MERN Stack developer, freelance web developer, or SEO-friendly website in Kathmandu, Nepal, I&#x27;d love to help.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"mailto:kundanprasadyadav15@gmail.com\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full bg-sky-500 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-sky-400\">kundanprasadyadav15@gmail.com</a><a href=\"tel:+9779742471815\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-slate-100 transition hover:border-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300\">+977 9742471815</a></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5d4dee3a564b7c38.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\nd:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/9621e70ff37352a7.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n4:T75f,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"[{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Kundan Prasad Yadav\\\",\\\"jobTitle\\\":\\\"MERN Stack Developer\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"B.Tech Computer Engineering graduate from NIMS University Jaipur, specializing in modern web development and freelance development in Kathmandu, Nepal.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://kundanprasadyadav.com.np\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"mailto:kundanprasadyadav15@gmail.com\\\",\\\"telephone\\\":\\\"+9779742471815\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://github.com/kundanYadav1.png\\\",\\\"address\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"PostalAddress\\\",\\\"addressLocality\\\":\\\"Kathmandu\\\",\\\"addressCountry\\\":\\\"Nepal\\\"},\\\"alumniOf\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CollegeOrUniversity\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"NIMS University Jaipur\\\"},\\\"sameAs\\\":[\\\"https://github.com/kundanYadav1\\\",\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kundan-prasad-yadav-9a7328192/\\\"],\\\"knowsAbout\\\":[\\\"MERN Stack\\\",\\\"React\\\",\\\"Next.js\\\",\\\"Node.js\\\",\\\"MongoDB\